stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Scheduled: created with start_date in the future
    Scheduled --> Active: start_date reached and is_active=true
    Active --> Expired: end_date passed
    Active --> Disabled: manager sets is_active=false
    Disabled --> Active: manager re-enables within the date range
    Disabled --> Expired: end_date passes while disabled
    Expired --> [*]
    note right of Active
        only Active offers are returned to customers
        and can be attached to a new offer_order line
    end note
